  "description": "发现国内好些人打乒乓球喜欢用红双喜那个WTT比赛用球。前面一个红双喜标志，后面一个WTT标志那种。",
  "body_html": "<p><span>发现国内好些人打乒乓球喜欢用红双喜那个WTT比赛用球。前面一个红双喜标志，后面一个WTT标志那种。</span></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqqT!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F50da7b7b-ff83-4b53-86b7-519859c44d3a_400x400.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqqT!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F50da7b7b-ff83-4b53-86b7-519859c44d3a_400x400.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqqT!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F50da7b7b-ff83-4b53-86b7-519859c44d3a_400x400.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqqT!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F50da7b7b-ff83-4b53-86b7-519859c44d3a_400x400.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqqT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F50da7b7b-ff83-4b53-86b7-519859c44d3a_400x400.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqqT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F50da7b7b-ff83-4b53-86b7-519859c44d3a_400x400.jpeg\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/50da7b7b-ff83-4b53-86b7-519859c44d3a_400x400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:400,&quot;width&quot;:400,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:41415,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://yinwang1.substack.com/i/209901852?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F50da7b7b-ff83-4b53-86b7-519859c44d3a_400x400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqqT!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F50da7b7b-ff83-4b53-86b7-519859c44d3a_400x400.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqqT!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F50da7b7b-ff83-4b53-86b7-519859c44d3a_400x400.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqqT!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F50da7b7b-ff83-4b53-86b7-519859c44d3a_400x400.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqqT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F50da7b7b-ff83-4b53-86b7-519859c44d3a_400x400.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><span>每当遇到拿WTT球的人，我都发现他们打球也很像WTT的比赛，基本只会来回对拉。球打得真好的大叔，很多用的银河，要么就是双鱼，几乎没有用红双喜的。</span></p><p><span>这红双喜WTT球，我在日本的时候也买过一盒，还是从淘宝发到日本的。我平时用的都是Nittaku Premium，这是我测试了好几种日本品牌的乒乓球之后选择的。大部分的日本品牌的球现在都是中国制造的，只有 Nittaku 至今一直是日本制造。</span></p><p><span>我在日本打球的那个俱乐部开头各种球都有。Butterfly，Victas…… 还有一些不知什么便宜劣质球，表面都磨得镜子一样反光了还在用。但我每次都带着自己的 Nittaku 去，而且每次我都事先用纳米海绵把球洗的干干净净的，保…</span></p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
  "truncated_body_text": "发现国内好些人打乒乓球喜欢用红双喜那个WTT比赛用球。前面一个红双喜标志，后面一个WTT标志那种。",
